>## Remove leading and trailing whitespace from a string
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term stripLeadingAndTrailingWhitespace = λs.strings.fromList (lists.dropWhile chars.isSpace (lists.reverse (lists.dropWhile chars.isSpace (lists.reverse (strings.toList s)))))
#^^^^ source.hydra keyword.other.definition.hydra
#    ^ source.hydra
